{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/7a75e8370da233204fe98821b080706b.poster.avif?t=1766655705\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/7a75e8370da233204fe98821b080706b.webm?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/e845ec2157f6c1b832c0576b0db2b41b.poster.avif?t=1766655705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/e845ec2157f6c1b832c0576b0db2b41b.webm?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/e845ec2157f6c1b832c0576b0db2b41b.mp4?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A well known <i>Detective</i> received an invitation by the wealthy <i>Viktor Von Schlonger</i> to take part to his infamous  dinner party, where only the richest, dodgiest and overall peculiar people in the world are welcomed, and only once a year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong>Crooked Knobs</strong>, you are said <i>Detective</i>. All fine, all simple. Just enjoy the vacation, relax your brain, and don't think much of the m\u00f6tley cr\u00fce of criminals and felons that will accompany you for the entire duration. Surely, none of them might have a reason to...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/2a0ba40ace08c3fcd60d42d551ce7cd3.poster.avif?t=1766655705\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/2a0ba40ace08c3fcd60d42d551ce7cd3.webm?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/a45bef01e57221f10a79019ac7cd5bf6.poster.avif?t=1766655705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/a45bef01e57221f10a79019ac7cd5bf6.webm?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/a45bef01e57221f10a79019ac7cd5bf6.mp4?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">ATTEMPTED murder why thank you, but still... heinous all the same. <i>Viktor Von Schlonger</i> is attacked and almost killed throughout the night, and the one who did it is certainly within reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Will you be able to solve the mystery, find the murderer, and motives behind their actions in this <i><strong>point-and-click murder mystery</strong></i>? Perhaps. But be wary, there's more than meets the eye  around...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/e888b76893d85c6c806e1405306f3b52.avif?t=1766655705\" width=600 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/0f29ea64c0a77dcf74c103f3b1b88a95.poster.avif?t=1766655705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/0f29ea64c0a77dcf74c103f3b1b88a95.webm?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/0f29ea64c0a77dcf74c103f3b1b88a95.mp4?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A huge, isolated Villa on top of a cliff of a remote Lewdropean peninsula, <i>Von Schlonger's Mansion</i>\u00a0ain't nothing to mess with. Over the years, the eccentric raccoon molded it into somewhat of a madhouse, chock full of fascinating vistas, childish arcade rooms, gold furniture... and <i>terrible secrets</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A similar place surely makes it easier to come up with a murder plan, with many hiding spots, escape routes, and improvised weapons. <strong>Crooked Knobs</strong> is all about being <i>observant</i>... and being observant is key, because if anyone knows this mansion inside and out, it is certainly...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/c5e4f12ad183551d8a91235d6b0b4874.poster.avif?t=1766655705\" width=600 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/c5e4f12ad183551d8a91235d6b0b4874.webm?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/ad89a50162c9297f5f5ba6793845f23a.poster.avif?t=1766655705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/ad89a50162c9297f5f5ba6793845f23a.webm?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/ad89a50162c9297f5f5ba6793845f23a.mp4?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Devious, friendly, ruthless, cold-hearted, loving, we have 'em all. None of the 12 guests roaming around the mansion can be completely trusted, but all of them can be helpful... with a little &quot;push&quot;. Yes, you can &quot;push&quot; them all. High morals are flexible anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Careful though... one (or more) of them <i><strong>is</strong></i> the <i>murderer</i>. And they'll make sure their &quot;help&quot; might throw you in the wrong direction to complicate the case further. Use all the instruments at your disposal and choose wisely, you only have <i>6 hours to spare</i> before letting them all go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fortunately, you're not exactly... <i>alone</i> on your quest. But I can't spoil everything now can I.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Only one way to find out all there is to know. I hope you'll enjoy <strong>Crooked Knobs</strong>. In more than one way, goes without saying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/027b9baa254e8186511a01d4d84e2fe0.apng?t=1766655705\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/027b9baa254e8186511a01d4d84e2fe0.poster.avif?t=1766655705\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=224 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery behind <i>Viktor Von Schlonger</i>'s attempted murder and his eccentric mansion in <strong><i>Five distinct murder cases</i></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet 12 different guests, and press them to tell you the truth. <strong><i>Where you press them and how deeply you'll do it, is up to you.</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an interconnected story <strong><i>full of twists and turns</i></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your observation skills to find evidence and put 6 and 9 together</strong>! Nothing during a case is signposted or covered in yellow paint, look around carefully, and <strong>don't leave any stone unturned</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Study your opponents through your Detective tools</strong>: have a chat, gather them all for a mass interrogation, spy on them when they disappear, or challenge them to a <strong>Tongue Wrestling Match</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not alone in this quest, your &quot;Partner&quot; will give you a hand~ <strong>with some of the most valuable tools in your arsenal</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See and unlock many, many, <i>MANY</i> <strong><i>spicy scenes</i></strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>ABOUT THESE &quot;AI CONTENT DISCLOSURE&quot; THAT ARE ALL THE RAGE NOWADAYS....</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>None of that here. Absolutely\u00a0<strong>NO ASSET</strong> in this game is, or will <strong>EVER</strong> be created, through the use of generative AI. That's why I ask you guys to be patient and bear with me, it is going to take a minute to get this done.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the meantime though, I've prepared a <strong>demo prologue</strong> to hold you over (releasing\u00a0<strong>December 15, 2025</strong>), containing <strong>all original content not present in the main game</strong>. Please enjoy!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/1678014f21be765a01bfbcbcb1543db2.avif?t=1766655705\" width=200 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/8fda3b555a7e5ad4a46acc089fe94199.avif?t=1766655705\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3979270?t=1766655705","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/caa10987f776b9624a7b6a408a7af4148fc934eb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766655705","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/13179c367699ae347eb3b7944f2067da1c97a998/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766655705","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/13179c367699ae347eb3b7944f2067da1c97a998/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766655705","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Sexual themes/scenes involving anthropomorphic characters"},"demos":[{"appid":3995600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/7a75e8370da233204fe98821b080706b.poster.avif?t=1766655705\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/7a75e8370da233204fe98821b080706b.webm?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/e845ec2157f6c1b832c0576b0db2b41b.poster.avif?t=1766655705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/e845ec2157f6c1b832c0576b0db2b41b.webm?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/e845ec2157f6c1b832c0576b0db2b41b.mp4?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-