</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A similar place surely makes it easier to come up with a murder plan, with many hiding spots, escape routes, and improvised weapons. <strong>Crooked Knobs</strong> is all about being <i>observant</i>... and being observant is key, because if anyone knows this mansion inside and out, it is certainly...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/c5e4f12ad183551d8a91235d6b0b4874.poster.avif?t=1766655705\" width=600 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/c5e4f12ad183551d8a91235d6b0b4874.webm?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/ad89a50162c9297f5f5ba6793845f23a.poster.avif?t=1766655705\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/ad89a50162c9297f5f5ba6793845f23a.webm?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/ad89a50162c9297f5f5ba6793845f23a.mp4?t=1766655705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Devious, friendly, ruthless, cold-hearted, loving, we have 'em all. None of the 12 guests roaming around the mansion can be completely trusted, but all of them can be helpful... with a little &quot;push&quot;. Yes, you can &quot;push&quot; them all. High morals are flexible anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Careful though... one (or more) of them <i><strong>is</strong></i> the <i>murderer</i>. And they'll make sure their &quot;help&quot; might throw you in the wrong direction to complicate the case further. Use all the instruments at your disposal and choose wisely, you only have <i>6 hours to spare</i> before letting them all go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fortunately, you're not exactly... <i>alone</i> on your quest. But I can't spoil everything now can I.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Only one way to find out all there is to know. I hope you'll enjoy <strong>Crooked Knobs</strong>. In more than one way, goes without saying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/027b9baa254e8186511a01d4d84e2fe0.apng?t=1766655705\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/027b9baa254e8186511a01d4d84e2fe0.poster.avif?t=1766655705\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=224 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mystery behind <i>Viktor Von Schlonger</i>'s attempted murder and his eccentric mansion in <strong><i>Five distinct murder cases</i></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet 12 different guests, and press them to tell you the truth. <strong><i>Where you press them and how deeply you'll do it, is up to you.</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an interconnected story <strong><i>full of twists and turns</i></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your observation skills to find evidence and put 6 and 9 together</strong>! Nothing during a case is signposted or covered in yellow paint, look around carefully, and <strong>don't leave any stone unturned</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Study your opponents through your Detective tools</strong>: have a chat, gather them all for a mass interrogation, spy on them when they disappear, or challenge them to a <strong>Tongue Wrestling Match</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not alone in this quest, your &quot;Partner&quot; will give you a hand~ <strong>with some of the most valuable tools in your arsenal</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See and unlock many, many, <i>MANY</i> <strong><i>spicy scenes</i></strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>ABOUT THESE &quot;AI CONTENT DISCLOSURE&quot; THAT ARE ALL THE RAGE NOWADAYS....</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>None of that here. Absolutely\u00a0<strong>NO ASSET</strong> in this game is, or will <strong>EVER</strong> be created, through the use of generative AI. That's why I ask you guys to be patient and bear with me, it is going to take a minute to get this done.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the meantime though, I've prepared a <strong>demo prologue</strong> to hold you over (releasing\u00a0<strong>December 15, 2025</strong>), containing <strong>all original content not present in the main game</strong>. Please enjoy!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/1678014f21be765a01bfbcbcb1543db2.avif?t=1766655705\" width=200 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/extras/8fda3b555a7e5ad4a46acc089fe94199.avif?t=1766655705\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p>","developers":["Arty The Frog"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979270/1e21058f995af85a0f59d9e9101743da722f3885/header.jpg?t=1766655705","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 - 2025 Arty The Frog. All Right Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 and later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.8 GHz Intel Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any GPU with at least 4GB of VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 and later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.8 GHz Intel Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any GPU with at least 8GB of VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3979270/590004183/578503e8f215c6d4c5ee1787cb75c8ad3c041d0d/1759839824/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759842109","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3979270/590004183/578503e8f215c6d4c5ee1787cb75c8ad3c041d0d/1759839824/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759842109","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3979270/590004183/578503e8f215c6d4c5ee1787cb75c8ad3c041d0d/1759839824/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759842109","id":257213504,"name":"2024 Announcement Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati